{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13456","headline":"送韩平兼寄郭微 · 刘眘虚","name":"送韩平兼寄郭微","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上客夜相过，小童能酤酒。\n即爲临水处，正值归鴈後。\n前路望乡山，近家见门柳。\n到时春未暮，风景自应有。\n余忆东州人，经年别来久。\n殷勤爲传语，日夕念携手。\n兼问前寄书，书中复达否。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘眘虚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13456.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13456","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}